<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><!DOCTYPE Bill PUBLIC "-//LSC//DTD Authoring Bill XML//EN" "billauthoring.top"><Bill version="1.0" type="introLN"><IntroducedBillHeader><RequestNumber>H-4024.1</RequestNumber><BillNumber>SUBSTITUTE HOUSE BILL 2578</BillNumber><StateLegSession><State>State of Washington</State><Legislature>63rd Legislature</Legislature><Session>2014 Regular Session</Session></StateLegSession><Sponsors>House Government Operations &amp; Elections (originally sponsored by Representatives Dunshee, DeBolt, and MacEwen)</Sponsors><IntroHistory><ReadDate>READ FIRST TIME 02/05/14.  </ReadDate></IntroHistory></IntroducedBillHeader><BriefDescription>Exempting from public inspection certain public works proposals and documents.</BriefDescription><BillBody><BillTitle><LineNumber line=" 1" page="1,1" hrt="no" />	AN ACT Relating to exempting from public inspection certain public<LineNumber line=" 2" page="1,2" />works proposals and documents; amending RCW 39.10.470; and reenacting<LineNumber line=" 3" page="1,3" />and amending RCW 43.131.408.</BillTitle><EnactingClause><LineNumber line=" 4" page="1,4" hrt="no" />BE IT ENACTED BY THE LEGISLATURE OF THE STATE OF WASHINGTON:</EnactingClause><BillSection type="amend"><LineNumber line=" 5" page="1,5" hrt="no" /><BegSecAmd><SecNum>Sec. </SecNum><BegSecText>RCW <Cite>39.10.470</Cite> and 2005 c 274 s 275 are each amended to<LineNumber line=" 6" page="1,6" />read as follows:</BegSecText><LineNumber line=" 7" page="1,7" hrt="no" /></BegSecAmd><RCWSLText>	(1) Except as provided in subsection<add>s</add> (2) <add>and (3)</add> of this section,<LineNumber line=" 8" page="1,8" />all proceedings, records, contracts, and other public records relating<LineNumber line=" 9" page="1,9" />to alternative public works transactions under this chapter shall be<LineNumber line="10" page="1,10" />open to the inspection of any interested person, firm, or corporation<LineNumber line="11" page="1,11" />in accordance with chapter 42.56 RCW.<paraend /><LineNumber line="12" page="1,12" hrt="no" />	(2) Trade secrets, as defined in RCW 19.108.010, or other<LineNumber line="13" page="1,13" />proprietary information submitted by a bidder, offeror, or contractor<LineNumber line="14" page="1,14" />in connection with an alternative public works transaction under this<LineNumber line="15" page="1,15" />chapter shall not be subject to chapter 42.56 RCW if the bidder,<LineNumber line="16" page="1,16" />offeror, or contractor specifically states in writing the reasons why<LineNumber line="17" page="1,17" />protection is necessary, and identifies the data or materials to be<LineNumber line="18" page="1,18" />protected.<paraend /><PageNumberFooter>		p. 1	SHB 2578</PageNumberFooter><LineNumber line=" 1" page="2,1" hrt="no" />	<add>(3) Proposals submitted in response to a competitive solicitation</add><LineNumber line=" 2" page="2,2" /><add>and related evaluation documents are exempt from disclosure until the</add><LineNumber line=" 3" page="2,3" /><add>public body announces the highest scoring finalist, in accordance with</add><LineNumber line=" 4" page="2,4" /><add>RCW 39.10.330, or the selection process is terminated.</add></RCWSLText></BillSection><BillSection type="remd"><LineNumber line=" 5" page="2,5" hrt="no" /><BegSecAmd><SecNum>Sec. </SecNum><BegSecText>RCW <Cite>43.131.408</Cite> and 2013 c 222 s 22 and 2013 c 186 s 2 are<LineNumber line=" 6" page="2,6" />each reenacted and amended to read as follows:</BegSecText><LineNumber line=" 7" page="2,7" hrt="no" /></BegSecAmd><RCWSLText>	The following acts or parts of acts, as now existing or hereafter<LineNumber line=" 8" page="2,8" />amended, are each repealed, effective June 30, 2022:<paraend /><LineNumber line=" 9" page="2,9" hrt="no" />	(1) RCW 39.10.200 and 2010 1st sp.s. c 21 s 2, 2007 c 494 s 1, &amp;<LineNumber line="10" page="2,10" />1994 c 132 s 1;<paraend /><LineNumber line="11" page="2,11" hrt="no" />	(2) RCW 39.10.210 and 2013 c 222 s 1, 2010 1st sp.s. c 36 s 6014,<LineNumber line="12" page="2,12" />2007 c 494 s 101, &amp; 2005 c 469 s 3;<paraend /><LineNumber line="13" page="2,13" hrt="no" />	(3) RCW 39.10.220 and 2013 c 222 s 2, 2007 c 494 s 102, &amp; 2005 c<LineNumber line="14" page="2,14" />377 s 1;<paraend /><LineNumber line="15" page="2,15" hrt="no" />	(4) RCW 39.10.230 and 2013 c 222 s 3, 2010 1st sp.s. c 21 s 3, 2009<LineNumber line="16" page="2,16" />c 75 s 1, 2007 c 494 s 103, &amp; 2005 c 377 s 2;<paraend /><LineNumber line="17" page="2,17" hrt="no" />	(5) RCW 39.10.240 and 2013 c 222 s 4 &amp; 2007 c 494 s 104;<paraend /><LineNumber line="18" page="2,18" hrt="no" />	(6) RCW 39.10.250 and 2013 c 222 s 5, 2009 c 75 s 2, &amp; 2007 c 494<LineNumber line="19" page="2,19" />s 105;<paraend /><LineNumber line="20" page="2,20" hrt="no" />	(7) RCW 39.10.260 and 2013 c 222 s 6 &amp; 2007 c 494 s 106;<paraend /><LineNumber line="21" page="2,21" hrt="no" />	(8) RCW 39.10.270 and 2013 c 222 s 7, 2009 c 75 s 3, &amp; 2007 c 494<LineNumber line="22" page="2,22" />s 107;<paraend /><LineNumber line="23" page="2,23" hrt="no" />	(9) RCW 39.10.280 and 2013 c 222 s 8 &amp; 2007 c 494 s 108;<paraend /><LineNumber line="24" page="2,24" hrt="no" />	(10) RCW 39.10.290 and 2007 c 494 s 109;<paraend /><LineNumber line="25" page="2,25" hrt="no" />	(11) RCW 39.10.300 and 2013 c 222 s 9, 2009 c 75 s 4, &amp; 2007 c 494<LineNumber line="26" page="2,26" />s 201;<paraend /><LineNumber line="27" page="2,27" hrt="no" />	(12) RCW 39.10.320 and 2013 c 222 s 10, 2007 c 494 s 203, &amp; 1994 c<LineNumber line="28" page="2,28" />132 s 7;<paraend /><LineNumber line="29" page="2,29" hrt="no" />	(13) RCW 39.10.330 and 2013 c 222 s 11, 2009 c 75 s 5, &amp; 2007 c 494<LineNumber line="30" page="2,30" />s 204;<paraend /><LineNumber line="31" page="2,31" hrt="no" />	(14) RCW 39.10.340 and 2013 c 222 s 12 &amp; 2007 c 494 s 301;<paraend /><LineNumber line="32" page="2,32" hrt="no" />	(15) RCW 39.10.350 and 2007 c 494 s 302;<paraend /><LineNumber line="33" page="2,33" hrt="no" />	(16) RCW 39.10.360 and 2013 c 222 s 13, 2009 c 75 s 6, &amp; 2007 c 494<LineNumber line="34" page="2,34" />s 303;<paraend /><LineNumber line="35" page="2,35" hrt="no" />	(17) RCW 39.10.370 and 2007 c 494 s 304;<paraend /><LineNumber line="36" page="2,36" hrt="no" />	(18) RCW 39.10.380 and 2013 c 222 s 14 &amp; 2007 c 494 s 305;<paraend /><LineNumber line="37" page="2,37" hrt="no" />	(19) RCW 39.10.385 and 2013 c 222 s 15 &amp; 2010 c 163 s 1;<paraend /><PageNumberFooter>	SHB 2578	p. 2	</PageNumberFooter><LineNumber line=" 1" page="3,1" hrt="no" />	(20) RCW 39.10.390 and 2013 c 222 s 16 &amp; 2007 c 494 s 306;<paraend /><LineNumber line=" 2" page="3,2" hrt="no" />	(21) RCW 39.10.400 and 2013 c 222 s 17 &amp; 2007 c 494 s 307;<paraend /><LineNumber line=" 3" page="3,3" hrt="no" />	(22) RCW 39.10.410 and 2007 c 494 s 308;<paraend /><LineNumber line=" 4" page="3,4" hrt="no" />	(23) RCW 39.10.420 and 2013 c 222 s 18, 2013 c 186 s 1, 2012 c 102<LineNumber line=" 5" page="3,5" />s 1, 2009 c 75 s 7, 2007 c 494 s 401, &amp; 2003 c 301 s 1;<paraend /><LineNumber line=" 6" page="3,6" hrt="no" />	(24) RCW 39.10.430 and 2007 c 494 s 402;<paraend /><LineNumber line=" 7" page="3,7" hrt="no" />	(25) RCW 39.10.440 and 2013 c 222 s 19 &amp; 2007 c 494 s 403;<paraend /><LineNumber line=" 8" page="3,8" hrt="no" />	(26) RCW 39.10.450 and 2012 c 102 s 2 &amp; 2007 c 494 s 404;<paraend /><LineNumber line=" 9" page="3,9" hrt="no" />	(27) RCW 39.10.460 and 2012 c 102 s 3 &amp; 2007 c 494 s 405;<paraend /><LineNumber line="10" page="3,10" hrt="no" />	(28) RCW 39.10.470 and <add>2014 c .<hardspace />.<hardspace />. s 1 (section 1 of this act),</add><LineNumber line="11" page="3,11" />2005 c 274 s 275<add>,</add> &amp; 1994 c 132 s 10;<paraend /><LineNumber line="12" page="3,12" hrt="no" />	(29) RCW 39.10.480 and 1994 c 132 s 9;<paraend /><LineNumber line="13" page="3,13" hrt="no" />	(30) RCW 39.10.490 and 2013 c 222 s 20, 2007 c 494 s 501, &amp; 2001 c<LineNumber line="14" page="3,14" />328 s 5;<paraend /><LineNumber line="15" page="3,15" hrt="no" />	(31) RCW 39.10.900 and 1994 c 132 s 13;<paraend /><LineNumber line="16" page="3,16" hrt="no" />	(32) RCW 39.10.901 and 1994 c 132 s 14;<paraend /><LineNumber line="17" page="3,17" hrt="no" />	(33) RCW 39.10.903 and 2007 c 494 s 510;<paraend /><LineNumber line="18" page="3,18" hrt="no" />	(34) RCW 39.10.904 and 2007 c 494 s 512; and<paraend /><LineNumber line="19" page="3,19" hrt="no" />	(35) RCW 39.10.905 and 2007 c 494 s 513.</RCWSLText></BillSection><BillEnd>--- END ---<PageNumberFooter lastpage="yes">		p. 3	SHB 2578</PageNumberFooter></BillEnd></BillBody></Bill>